        ['How much heat is needed to melt 0.2 kg of ice at 0 °C? (L = 3.36 × 10⁵ J/kg)', ['6.72 × 10⁴ J', '6.72 × 10³ J', '1.68 × 10⁶ J', '4.52 × 10⁵ J'], 'A', 'Q = mL.', 2],
