        ['A tuning fork of frequency 256 Hz gives the first resonance in a closed tube. Taking v = 340 m/s and neglecting end correction, find the length of the air column.', ['66.4 cm', '132.8 cm', '33.2 cm', '99.6 cm'], 'C', 'L = λ/4 = v ÷ 4f.', 4],
        ['A tuning fork of frequency 480 Hz gives the first resonance in a closed tube. Taking v = 340 m/s and neglecting end correction, find the length of the air column.', ['35.4 cm', '70.8 cm', '53.1 cm', '17.7 cm'], 'D', 'L = λ/4 = v ÷ 4f.', 4],
