        ['Sound waves can be polarised.', ['True', 'False'], 'B', 'They are longitudinal.', 3, 'tf'],
        ['The echo from a wall returns after 3 s. If sound travels at 340 m/s, the wall is ___ m away.', ['510'], '', 'd = vt ÷ 2.', 2, 'fill'],
