        ['A cell of e.m.f. 12 V and internal resistance 0.5 Ω is connected to a 10 Ω resistor. Find the current.', ['1.143 A', '1.2 A', '24 A', '1.263 A'], 'A', 'I = E ÷ (R + r).', 3],
