    'SHS 3: Electromagnetic induction and transformers' => [
        ['Electromagnetic induction is', ['the production of an e.m.f. in a conductor when the magnetic flux linking it changes', 'the magnetisation of iron', 'the flow of electrons in a wire', 'heating by current'], 'A', 'Discovered by Faraday.', 2],
        ['Lenz\'s law states that the induced current flows in a direction to', ['increase the change', 'oppose the change producing it', 'be parallel to the field', 'stop all current'], 'B', 'Conservation of energy.', 3],
