        ['A transformer works only with', ['direct current', 'static charge', 'magnets alone', 'alternating current'], 'D', 'It needs a changing flux.', 1],
        ['A step-up transformer has', ['more turns on the secondary than on the primary', 'fewer secondary turns', 'equal turns', 'no core'], 'A', 'Vs > Vp.', 1],
