        ['A transformer has 500 primary turns and 400 secondary turns. If the primary voltage is 11,000 V, find the secondary voltage.', ['8,800 V', '13,750 V', '11,000 V', '4,400,000 V'], 'A', 'Vs/Vp = Ns/Np.', 2],
