        ['A transformer has 500 primary turns and 4,000 secondary turns. If the primary voltage is 11,000 V, find the secondary voltage.', ['1,375 V', '11,000 V', '44,000,000 V', '88,000 V'], 'D', 'Vs/Vp = Ns/Np.', 2],
