        ['Adding impurities to a semiconductor is called ___.', ['doping'], '', 'Creates n- and p-type.', 2, 'fill'],
        ['The process of converting a.c. to d.c. is called ___.', ['rectification'], '', 'Uses diodes.', 2, 'fill'],
        ['In n-type material, the majority charge carriers are ___.', ['electrons'], '', 'From pentavalent impurities.', 3, 'fill'],
        ['A diode that emits light when forward biased is called an ___.', ['LED', 'light-emitting diode', 'light emitting diode'], '', 'Light-emitting diode.', 1, 'fill'],
