        ['A wire of cross-sectional area 2 × 10⁻⁶ m² carries a load of 500 N. Find the stress.', ['1 × 10⁻³ Pa', '2.5 × 10⁵ Pa', '4 × 10⁻⁹ Pa', '2.5 × 10⁸ Pa'], 'D', 'Stress = F ÷ A.', 3],
