        ['A wire of cross-sectional area 5 × 10⁻⁶ m² carries a load of 100 N. Find the stress.', ['5 × 10⁻⁴ Pa', '2 × 10⁴ Pa', '5 × 10⁻⁸ Pa', '2 × 10⁷ Pa'], 'D', 'Stress = F ÷ A.', 3],
