        ['Sea breezes blow from sea to land during the day because', ['the sea is warmer', 'land heats up faster, so warm air over land rises and cool air from the sea replaces it', 'land cools faster', 'wind always blows inland'], 'B', 'Convection current.', 3],
        ['The best emitter and absorber of radiant heat is a', ['shiny white surface', 'polished silver surface', 'dull black surface', 'transparent surface'], 'C', 'Leslie cube experiment.', 2],
