        ['A fireman\'s suit is shiny on the outside to', ['conduct heat away', 'reflect radiant heat', 'absorb heat', 'cause convection'], 'B', 'Protection from fires.', 2],
        ['Which of these is the best insulator?', ['copper', 'aluminium', 'still air', 'iron'], 'C', 'Trapped air in wool and fibreglass.', 1],
